OL,3,AEmbattled Spanish PM insists no prior
OL,4,Awarnings before Ceuta crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,7,Fhas said no-one foresaw the influx of
OL,8,F72,000 migrants in the exclave of
OL,9,FCeuta, as pressure mounts over his
OL,10,Fhandling of the crisis.
OL,12,F"It's absurd to think that the
OL,13,Fgovernment knew and did nothing,"
OL,14,FSanchez told Spain's parliament on
OL,15,FThursday, hours after tens of thousands
OL,16,Fof people joined protests across the
OL,17,Fcountry backed by opposition parties.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
